{"seq":14,"slug":"programmer-english","title":"程序员英语","stage":"DONE","category":"english-learning","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english","rating":{"composite":4.42,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 程序员英语 简介\n\n程序员英语是一门面向中文母语开发者的实用英语学习指南，聚焦软件工程日常中最高频的英语使用场景——从代码命名到技术沟通，从文档阅读到演讲表达，包括 AI 工具协作与开源贡献场景。\n\n与通用英语不同，程序员英语有其独特的词汇体系、表达惯例和文化语境。一个精准的变量名能让代码自文档化，一段得体的 Code Review 评论能促进团队协作，一次流利的 Tech Talk 能建立技术影响力，一份清晰的 prompt 能让 AI 工具产出可用代码。掌握这些技能不仅是语言能力的提升，更是工程师职业发展的加速器。\n\n**本 hub 不包含**：通用语法 / 一般词汇 / 应试英语——这些归 `02_english-vocabulary` / `03_english-grammar-advanced`；通用阅读 / 写作技巧归 `04_english-reading` / `07_english-writing-practice`。本 hub 只装\"程序员场景化\"的英语。\n\n本知识库按使用场景划分为四个核心章节，外加 2026-05 后扩展的 AI 时代与开源场景：\n\n第一章**代码命名英语**系统讲解变量、函数、类和模块的英语命名技巧，涵盖动词选择、前缀后缀规律、设计模式命名惯例，以及 **AI 辅助编程（Copilot / Claude Code / Cursor）时代的命名一致性考量**。\n\n第二章**技术读写英语**聚焦开发者最常接触的读写场景：阅读 RFC 和 API 文档、撰写 PR Description 和 Review Comments、发表技术博客（含 **Build-in-public 写作框架**），以及 **AI Prompt 写作**作为一种新型技术写作子体（ICFC 模型、动词精度梯度、反 Chinglish 模式）。\n\n第三章**技术沟通英语**涵盖远程协作时代的口头与书面沟通能力：Standup Meeting 句式、Slack / Email 异步沟通、技术演讲与**线上 Tech Talk + Q&A**、**AI 工具协作场景的英语**、以及 **开源协作英语**（首次贡献、drive-by PR、RFC 讨论、维护者回应）。\n\n第四章**领域专业词汇**按技术方向整理高频术语表：系统架构、前后端开发、DevOps 与云计算，以及 **AI / LLM 领域 8 大子领域术语**（模型基础、tokenization、采样、prompt 工程、RAG / agent、失败模式、评估、成本延迟）。\n\n建议学习路径：先通读第一章建立命名语感，再根据日常工作需要选读第二章或第三章的对应内容，最后将第四章作为日常查阅的词汇手册。AI 工具与开源贡献的相关条目可随实践随时跳读。每篇文章均提供可直接使用的例句和模板，鼓励在实际工作中即学即用。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"code-naming-conventions","title":"代码命名英语","docCount":3,"url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/code-naming-conventions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"variable-function-naming","title":"变量与函数命名英语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/code-naming-conventions/variable-function-naming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"class-module-naming","title":"类与模块命名体系","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/code-naming-conventions/class-module-naming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-naming-patterns","title":"领域术语与命名模式","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/code-naming-conventions/domain-naming-patterns"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"technical-reading-writing","title":"技术读写英语","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reading-technical-docs","title":"技术文档阅读策略","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/reading-technical-docs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pr-code-review-english","title":"PR 与 Code Review 英语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/pr-code-review-english"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tech-blog-writing","title":"技术博客写作英语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/tech-blog-writing"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-prompt-english","title":"AI Prompt 英语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/ai-prompt-english"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"communication-english","title":"技术沟通英语","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"meeting-standup-english","title":"技术会议与站会英语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/meeting-standup-english"},{"seq":2,"slug":"remote-collaboration","title":"远程协作沟通英语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/remote-collaboration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tech-talk-english","title":"技术演讲英语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/tech-talk-english"},{"seq":4,"slug":"open-source-collaboration-english","title":"开源协作英语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/open-source-collaboration-english"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"domain-vocabulary","title":"领域专业词汇","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/domain-vocabulary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-vocabulary","title":"系统架构核心词汇","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/domain-vocabulary/architecture-vocabulary"},{"seq":2,"slug":"frontend-backend-terms","title":"前端与后端专业术语","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/domain-vocabulary/frontend-backend-terms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"devops-cloud-vocabulary","title":"DevOps 与云计算词汇","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/domain-vocabulary/devops-cloud-vocabulary"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-llm-vocabulary","title":"AI 与 LLM 领域词汇","url":"/h/english-learning/programmer-english/domain-vocabulary/ai-llm-vocabulary"}]}]}